<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-22T08:19:02.412Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:19:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The International Court of Justice has found Myanmar guilty of genocide against the Rohingya, a ruling the junta denounced as unfair while rights groups call for sanctions. Since the ruling, junta forces have destroyed bridges in Arakan, advanced west of the Sittaung River, begun planning a 108‑kilometre fence on the Bangladesh border, and carried out an airstrike on a displacement camp in Rakhine. In Sagaing the junta killed 11 people and Starlink outages have isolated communities as health facilities continued to be attacked in October 2026. Rohingya activists say their struggle for justice remains unfinished, and there were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/europe/myanmar-genocide-icj-decision-.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/21/rohingya-who-escaped-myanmars-genocide-tell-their-stories&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168853&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/law/2026/nov/20/us-eu-reaction-myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj-ruling-trump-international-law&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOcVY0LUZJSnV1ME83aWZYRUxCcUNxeUFMc3EzbkJoSGtRcHRuVjczdngwRmtCTWJEN1N2YlRqVzJOOGxidTd0a3RuNFdsSkg2UEJtMW9yMTcxMnU1UmJNTFhhZlJMdnRWQXV4QWFtUERhbi1